tionale, transformed_mechanism, variant_names, nearest_work_difference, falsifier}]. Cover retrieved industry cards; identify the concrete changed mechanism for used cards. This is provenance, not causal proof.\", \"reflection\": \"Review the latest knowledge-usage.json alongside outcomes; distinguish declared use, executed changes, mechanism evidence and unresolved attribution.\"}\nlatest_knowledge_usage {\"revision\": \"knowledge-access-v3\", \"retrieved_ids\": [\"unirank-method-hiformer\", \"unirank-method-rankmixer\", \"unirank-method-infnet\", \"unirank-method-longer\", \"unirank-method-onetrans\", \"unirank-method-zenith\", \"unirank-method-hyformer\", \"unirank-method-mixformer\", \"unirank-method-tokenmixer\", \"unirank-method-est\", \"unirank-method-hemix\", \"unirank-method-unimixer\", \"unirank-method-tokenformer\", \"unirank-method-ultrahstu\", \"unirank-method-ssr\", \"paper:din\", \"paper:dmr\", \"paper:infnet\", \"paper:tokenformer\"], \"assessments\": [{\"knowledge_id\": \"unirank-method-infnet\", \"decision\": \"used\", \"rationale\": \"Current card, pinned benchmark forward and original arXiv:2508.11565v1 method sections inspected. Task-specific historical means directly address the union-content bottleneck suggested by the count-only outcomes; earlier declared use did not mean the previous count sidecar implemented hubs.\", \"transformed_mechanism\": \"Borrow behavior-specific masked averaging, intersect it with explicit target category/brand relations and retain exact counts. Twelve fixed means feed auxiliary residuals; no learned hub, proxy attention or iterative broadcast.\", \"variant_names\": [\"aligned_blocked\", \"rotated_blocked\", \"aligned_shared\", \"rotated_shared\"], \"nearest_work_difference\": \"Our exact relational membership and source-path gate differ from behavior-pooled sequence proxies followed by alternating attention/PGUs. No INFNet effectiveness is imported.\", \"falsifier\": \"Aligned membership must beat count-preserving 